1 polymer     man DHP1                  11815.356 1 ? ? ? 
;DE NOVO DESIGN
A 108 AMINO ACID PROTEIN WAS DESIGNED AND CONSTRUCTED FROM
A REDUCED ALPHABET OF SEVEN AMINO ACIDS.  THE 2.9 ANGSTROM
CRYSTAL STRUCTURE CONFIRMS THAT THE PROTEIN IS A FOUR HELIX
BUNDLE, AS IT WAS DESIGNED TO BE.  THE COMPLETE 108
RESIDUE SEQUENCE IS PRESENTED ON SEQRES RECORDS BELOW.
THE HELICES WERE CONNECTED BY LOOPS OF 3, 4, 3 GLYCINES,
RESPECTIVELY.
THE MOLECULE CONTAINS A CRYSTALLOGRAPHIC TW0-FOLD AXIS OF
SYMMETRY THROUGH THE CENTER OF THE 4-HELIX BUNDLE.  THIS
UNUSUAL ARRANGEMENT IS DUE TO THE SYNTHETIC NATURE OF THE
MOLECULE IN WHICH THE SAME SEQUENCE SEGMENTS REPEAT.  THE
SYMMETRY OPERATION REQUIRED TO GENERATE THE ENTIRE BUNDLE
IS (-Y+1, -X+1, 1/3-Z) AND IS GIVEN IN REMARK 350 AS AN
OPERATOR ON THE COORDINATES IN THIS ENTRY.
;
2 non-polymer syn 'UNKNOWN ATOM OR ION' ?         2 ? ? ? ? 
3 water       nat water                 18.015    2 ? ? ? ? 
